Commands to add the upstream remote:

    git remote add upstream git@github.com:sethcottle/littlelink.git \
    && git fetch --all

Commands to create other head shot sizes using [make] and [ImageMagick]:

    make -C images

[make]: https://www.gnu.org/software/make/make.html
[ImageMagick]: https://imagemagick.org/
